msgid "Add a provider through a built-in or external package"
msgstr "通过内置包或外置包接入 provider"

msgid ""
"Use this guide to connect a concrete C11 implementation to the "
"static factory, configuration resolver and source SDK. Choose one "
"source owner below, then follow the same lifecycle and verification "
"contract. A similar peripheral name does not establish compatible "
"registers, a Board route or physical qualification."
msgstr ""
"本指南帮助你将具体 C11 实现接入静态 factory、配置解析器和源码 "
"SDK。先选择下述一种源码归属，再遵循共同的生命周期与验证合同。外设名称相似并不能证明寄存器兼容、Board 路线成立或已取得物理资格。"

msgid ""
"Read the [integration contract](../design/integration-contracts.md),"
" [provider construction contract](../design/official-stm32-provider."
"md#build-time-provider-contract) and [selected assembly "
"checks](../design/provider-assemblies.md) first."
msgstr ""
"请先阅读[接入契约](../design/integration-contracts.md)、[provider "
"构造合同](../design/official-stm32-provider.md#build-time-provider-contr"
"act)和[选定装配检查](../design/provider-assemblies.md)。"

