msgstr "选择一条接入路径"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:33
msgid ""
"![Current decision for shared register algorithms and exact SoC "
"integration](../assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![共享寄存器算法与精确 SoC 集成的当前判定](../assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg)"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:33
msgid ""
"Current decision for shared register algorithms and exact SoC integration"
msgstr "共享寄存器算法与精确 SoC 集成的当前判定"

msgid ""
"FIG-31 shows maintenance decisions, not runtime calls. A shared "
"driver requires reviewed register layout, flags, reset ordering and "
"errata for every selecting chip. The exact SoC owns routes and "
"admission even when it reuses that driver."
msgstr ""
"FIG-31 表示维护决策，不表示运行时调用。共享驱动要求逐一审核每个选用芯片的寄存器布局、标志位、复位顺序与勘误。即使复用该驱动，精确"
" SoC 仍负责路线与准入。"

msgid "Built-in implementation"
msgstr "内置实现"

msgid ""
"Select an existing exact `soc/<vendor>/<family>/` or add a reviewed "
"family descriptor with that canonical `source_directory`. Keep "
"public family IDs independent of directory names. Add exact "
"`soc.json` and `routes.json` facts; Board facts remain separate. "
"Preserve unknown electrical and PCB information. Register the "
"data-only descriptor in the existing explicit maintained map; an "
"external package does not edit that map."
msgstr ""
"选择现有的精确 `soc/<vendor>/<family>/`，或新增已审系列描述符并声明该规范 "
"`source_directory`。公共系列 ID 应独立于目录名。补充精确的 `soc.json` 和 `routes.json` "
"事实；Board 事实仍单独维护。保留电气与 PCB 信息中的未知项。将只含数据的描述符登记到现有的显式维护映射；外置包不修改该映射。"

msgid ""
"Define admitted full part numbers and modes in the family's "
"`configure/contract.py`. `bindings.py` supplies typed "
"`Construction` values; `emission.py` supplies static declarations "
"and explicit typed lifecycle calls. The leaf contract must not "
"import the top-level resolver or emitter. Declare configuration "
"helpers in the descriptor so reconfiguration and SDK closure "
"include them."
msgstr ""
"在系列的 `configure/contract.py` 中定义准入的完整料号与模式。`bindings.py` 提供类型化的 "
"`Construction` 值；`emission.py` "
"提供静态声明与显式类型化生命周期调用。叶级合同不得导入顶层解析器或生成器。在描述符中声明配置辅助模块，使重新配置和 SDK "
"闭包包含这些模块。"

msgid ""
"Add concrete C sources and private dependencies to the family's "
"explicit CMake target. Export the selected target and the required "
"startup/system inputs. Configure must reject a missing, imported or "
"incorrectly typed provider target, invalid private include roots "
"and missing MCU lifecycle inputs before building."
msgstr ""
"将具体 C 源码和私有依赖加入该系列的显式 CMake target。导出选定 target 以及必需的 startup/system "
"输入。配置阶段必须在构建前拒绝缺失、imported 或类型不正确的 provider target、无效的私有 include "
"根目录，以及缺失的 MCU 生命周期输入。"

msgid ""
"Add the exact authored TOML fixture to the maintained assembly "
"catalogue and the applicable SDK consumer plan. Execute the "
"behavior and build checks below."
msgstr "将精确的 authored TOML fixture 加入维护的装配目录和适用的 SDK 消费者计划。执行下述行为与构建检查。"

msgid ""
"Use the shared CPU resolver for ABI and feature selection. Do not "
"duplicate CPU flags or infer optional features from a family name. "
"A descriptor lookup must remain a data-only operation and must not "
"import another family's implementation."
msgstr ""
"复用公共 CPU 解析器选择 ABI 和特性。不要重复维护 CPU "
"标志，也不要从系列名推断可选特性。描述符查找必须保持为只读取数据的操作，不得导入其他系列的实现。"

msgid "External implementation"
msgstr "外置实现"

msgid ""
"Start with the complete [canonical external provider "
"starter](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION"
"-SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/external_provider/README.md). It "
"is exported at `share/nexus/src/cmake/package/verification/external_"
"provider` in a source SDK. Checkout contracts and SDK consumers "
"copy those same files; there is no separate test implementation to "
"keep synchronized."
msgstr ""
"从完整的[规范外置 provider 起步包](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXU"
"S-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/external_provider/"
"README.md)开始。源码 SDK 将其导出到 `share/nexus/src/cmake/package/verificatio"
"n/external_provider`。源码树合同测试与 SDK 消费者复制同一份文件；无需另行同步一份测试实现。"

msgid "From an external work directory, with a verified SDK already available:"
msgstr "在外部工作目录中操作，并事先准备好已验证的 SDK："

msgid ""
"A zero exit verifies the starter's Native software model: two "
"independent GPIO contexts, shared readonly ops, pure factory "
"lookup, a second-prepare failure, rollback of the first instance, "
"withdrawn I/O and repeated recovery. It does not establish a new "
"MCU, PCB route or HIL result. Paths with spaces are supported. The "
"project uses an explicit SDK; it never searches for a checkout "
"fallback."
msgstr ""
"退出码为零表示起步包的 Native 软件模型检查通过：两个独立 GPIO context、共享只读 ops、纯 factory "
"查询、第二次 prepare 失败、第一实例回滚、I/O 撤回和重复恢复。这不建立新 MCU、PCB 路线或 HIL "
"结果。路径可以包含空格。工程显式使用 SDK，绝不搜索源码树作为回退。"

msgid ""
"Keep the authored assembly's `soc_package` and `board_package` "
"explicit and relative to that TOML. The package family must match "
"Board facts and cannot shadow a built-in family. Replace the "
"starter's model facts only with reviewed facts for the actual "
"selected implementation."
msgstr ""
"在 authored 装配中显式保留 `soc_package` 和 `board_package`，路径相对于该 "
"TOML。包的系列必须与 Board 事实一致，且不得覆盖内置系列。只有在具备实际选定实现的已审事实后，才能替换起步包的模型事实。"

msgid ""
"Maintain `nexus-soc.json` with schema/interface version 1, package "
"identity, `source_directory`, `configuration_directory` and "
"declared `inputs`. The [schema](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/b"
"lob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/soc-package.schema.js"
"on) provides editor hints; runtime validation remains "
"authoritative. Every source, CMake input, private header and "
"configuration helper consumed from the package must be declared."
msgstr ""
"维护 `nexus-soc.json`，声明 schema/interface 版本 "
"1、包身份、`source_directory`、`configuration_directory` 和 "
"`inputs`。[schema](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCU"
"MENTATION-SOURCE/tools/configure/soc-package.schema.json)提供编辑器提示；运行时"
"验证仍是权威。从包中消费的每份源码、CMake 输入、私有头文件和配置辅助模块都必须显式声明。"

msgid ""
"Implement the package's explicit CMake target and configuration "
"modules under the same construction contract as a built-in "
"provider. Package CMake and Python are explicitly selected trusted "
"host code. They define no firmware interpreter, discovery service "
"or second build graph."
msgstr ""
"按照与内置 provider 相同的构造合同，实现包的显式 CMake target 和配置模块。包的 CMake 与 Python "
"是显式选定的受信主机代码；它们不定义固件解释器、发现服务或第二份构建图。"

msgid ""
"After reviewing changed source, refresh existing declared hashes "
"and check the package with the SDK's tool. Run these commands from "
"the copied starter root:"
msgstr "审核变更源码后，使用 SDK 工具刷新现有声明的摘要并检查包。从复制后的起步包根目录运行以下命令："

msgid ""
"Refresh updates only already declared paths; add a new input "
"deliberately before refreshing. It preserves the package version "
"and rejects missing files. Check reads metadata and digests without "
"executing provider code. Provider checking resolves and validates "
"the selected implementation. Unsupported modes, unknown fields, "
"duplicate keys, escaped paths, symlinks, stale digests and "
"unsupported interface versions reject without falling back to "
"another family."
msgstr ""
"刷新只更新已经声明的路径；新增输入必须先显式声明再刷新。它保留包版本，并拒绝缺失文件。检查只读取元数据与摘要，不执行 provider "
"代码。provider 检查会解析并验证选定实现。不支持的模式、未知字段、重复键、越界路径、符号链接、过期摘要和不支持的接口版本都会被拒"
"绝，不会回退到其他系列。"

msgid ""
"Rebuild the copied project against both the checkout and the "
"installed SDK. Move the SDK prefix to a path containing spaces and "
"build a fresh consumer there. SDK fixture requirements, copying and "
"identity comparisons expand the same verified manifest; unrelated "
"package files are not discovered as inputs."
msgstr ""
"分别使用源码树和已安装 SDK 重新构建复制后的工程。将 SDK 前缀移动到含空格的路径，并在那里构建全新消费者。SDK "
"fixture 必需文件、复制和身份比较都从同一份已验证 manifest 展开；不将无关包文件自动发现为输入。"

msgid ""
"`interface_version` gates compatibility. The package's `version` "
"identifies its reviewed source; it does not express a consumer "
"semver request. Declare external vendor source and locks explicitly "
"in `inputs`. `soc.source_lock` belongs to Nexus-managed "
"dependencies and does not validate an arbitrary external checkout. "
"Declared Python imports use verified source bytes; undeclared "
"helpers and stale bytecode cannot supply configuration behavior. "
"SDK packaging does not import the provider merely to enumerate its "
"files."
msgstr ""
"`interface_version` 控制兼容性准入。包的 `version` 标识已审源码，不表示消费者提出的 semver "
"版本要求。在 `inputs` 中显式声明外部 vendor 源码与锁。`soc.source_lock` 属于 Nexus "
"管理的依赖，不验证任意外部源码树。已声明 Python 模块的导入使用已验证源码字节；未声明的辅助模块和过期字节码不能提供配置行为。SD"
"K 打包不会仅为枚举文件而导入 provider。"

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:129
msgid "Keep facts and admission policy distinct"
msgstr "区分事实与准入策略"

msgid ""
"SoC and Board JSON describe hardware facts; the provider contract "
"admits exact parts and modes. The resolver constructs the sole "
"immutable decision rather than treating a fact file as an "
"executable selection policy. Part density, package pins, clock "
"domains, IRQ/DMA reachability and mode-specific resource ownership "
"must agree before generation. Unknown wiring or silicon revisions "
"remain explicit and cannot be repaired by choosing a different mode."
msgstr ""
"SoC 与 Board JSON 描述硬件事实；provider "
"合同准入精确料号与模式。解析器构造唯一的不可变决策，不将事实文件当作可执行选择策略。生成前必须确认芯片容量、封装引脚、时钟域、IRQ/D"
"MA 可达性和模式相关资源所有权相互一致。未知接线或硅修订必须明确保留，不能通过选择其他模式来修补。"

msgid ""
"`ConfigurationIR.physical_part` and `ControllerIR.integration` "
"reference existing physical facts and selected resource, clock, IRQ "
"and DMA plans. Reuse those objects; do not create another routing "
"or register interpretation in the factory. Vendor types and "
"register behavior remain private C implementation details."
msgstr ""
"`ConfigurationIR.physical_part` 和 `ControllerIR.integration` "
"引用既有物理事实以及选定的资源、时钟、IRQ 和 DMA 计划。复用这些对象；不要在 factory "
"中另建一套路由或寄存器解释。vendor 类型与寄存器行为仍属于私有 C 实现细节。"

msgid "Implement and verify the lifecycle"
msgstr "实现并验证生命周期"

msgid ""
"Write and execute the meaningful failing contract before changing "
"production behavior. Keep the actual RED command, nonzero result "
"and contemporaneous source and binary. Python tool behavior uses "
"stdlib unittest; new C API/provider contracts use host "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock against the real C algorithm through hardware "
"ports. Missing tools and compile errors are not behavioral RED "
"evidence."
msgstr ""
"改变生产行为前，先编写并执行有意义的失败合同。保留实际 RED 命令、非零结果以及执行当时的源码和二进制。Python "
"工具行为使用标准库 unittest；新的 C API/provider 合同通过硬件端口，使用主机 "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock 测试真实 C 算法。缺少工具和编译错误不构成行为 RED 证据。"

msgid ""
"The generated factory returns existing static readonly faces by "
"compact typed ID. It must not allocate, initialize hardware, "
"acquire locks or discover devices. Instances share readonly "
"operation tables and retain independent private context. Callbacks "
"receive that context. Controller and endpoint IDs remain distinct."
msgstr ""
"生成的 factory 通过紧凑类型 ID 返回既有静态只读 "
"face。它不得分配存储、初始化硬件、获取锁或发现器件。实例共享只读操作表，并保留各自独立的私有 context。回调接收该 "
"context。控制器 ID 与端点 ID 保持区分。"

msgid ""
"Keep hardware admission, register access, waits, pin/clock/IRQ/DMA "
"acquisition, rollback, stop and recovery in concrete C11 adapters. "
"Host Python validates facts and emits static declarations, exact "
"storage and explicit typed calls. Review the [official driver "
"boundary](../design/official-stm32-provider.md) before duplicating "
"HAL/LL/SPL behavior. Do not add a runtime register script, name "
"registry, maximum object pool, hidden worker or mandatory OS lock."
msgstr ""
"将硬件准入、寄存器访问、等待、引脚/时钟/IRQ/DMA 获取、回滚、停止与恢复保留在具体 C11 适配器中。主机 Python "
"验证事实，并生成静态声明、精确存储和显式类型化调用。重复实现 HAL/LL/SPL "
"行为前，先审核[官方驱动边界](../design/official-stm32-provider.md)。不要加入运行时寄存器脚本、名"
"称注册表、最大对象池、隐藏 worker 或强制 OS 锁。"

msgid ""
"The C prepare path must validate foreign ownership before effects. "
"The close path must validate its receipt before changing an "
"existing provider; an empty alien receipt leaves unowned state "
"unchanged. Preserve every unfinished resource claim after partial "
"preparation until readback proves return. Exercise partial "
"receipts, stop after public shutdown, repeated failure/recovery and "
"instance isolation."
msgstr ""
"C prepare 路径必须在产生副作用前检查外部所有权。close 路径必须先验证其凭据，才能改变既有 "
"provider；外来的空凭据应使未持有的状态保持不变。部分准备后，应保留所有尚未归还的资源声明，直到读回证明归还完成。测试部分凭据、公"
"共接口已关闭后的再次停止、重复失败/恢复和实例隔离。"

msgid ""
"For asynchronous modes, rejected admission retains no references or "
"effects. Accepted requests and buffers remain borrowed until "
"acquire-observed SETTLED. Cancel or deadline expiry does not revoke "
"that borrow. Failed drain retains QUARANTINED storage and explicit "
"recovery responsibility. Remove IRQ, hardware and queue references "
"before release-publication of completion."
msgstr ""
"异步模式下，准入被拒绝后不得保留引用或副作用。已接受的请求与缓冲区持续处于借用状态，直到调用者以 acquire 语义观察到 "
"SETTLED。取消或 deadline 到期不撤销借用。排空失败时保留 QUARANTINED 存储和明确的恢复责任。以 "
"release 语义发布完成前，先移除 IRQ、硬件与队列引用。"

msgid ""
"Keep vendor headers, handles and mutable storage private to their "
"targets. Inspect actual public consumer compile commands and "
"include probes, not only target property names. The optional host "
"framework requires C++17; production firmware remains C11 and never "
"links GoogleTest or its runtime."
msgstr ""
"vendor 头文件、Handle 和可变存储必须保持在各自 target 的私有范围内。检查公共消费者的实际编译命令与 "
"include 探针，不能只看 target 属性名。可选主机框架需要 C++17；生产固件仍使用 C11，绝不链接 "
"GoogleTest 或其运行时。"

msgid ""
"Execute GREEN, then refactor while retaining the contracts. Build "
"the exact existing STM32 and GD32 selections with the ARM "
"toolchain, check ELF resources, selected handlers and "
"unselected-driver pruning, and run relocated SDK consumers. Compare "
"the same empty image with the added mode, reporting Flash LOAD, "
"footprint and each RAM domain separately. Native models establish "
"modeled software behavior; ARM builds establish their compile/link "
"boundary. Real PCB, clock, DMA, cache and electrical acceptance "
"require physical station execution."
msgstr ""
"执行 GREEN 后，在保留合同通过的前提下重构。用 ARM 工具链构建现有的精确 STM32 与 GD32 选择，检查 ELF "
"资源、选定处理函数的保留和未选驱动的裁剪，并运行迁移后的 SDK 消费者。对比同一空镜像与增加该模式后的镜像，分别报告 Flash "
"LOAD、Flash footprint 和各 RAM 域。Native 模型建立所建模的软件行为证据；ARM "
"构建建立对应编译/链接边界。真实 PCB、时钟、DMA、cache 与电气验收需要物理 station 实际执行。"

msgid ""
"Application examples remain in the external private examples "
"repository. Keep product roles, tasks, private partitions and "
"recovery policy there; the public starter contains only reusable "
"integration mechanisms and software tests."
msgstr "应用示例保留在外部私有示例仓库。产品角色、任务、私有分区与恢复策略仍由该仓库维护；公共起步包只包含可复用接入机制和软件测试。"
